<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Volkswagen AG.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Volkswagen AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein AG has issued three million American-style call warrants, in three equal tranches, on Volkswagen AG, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS CONTROL ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 20.JAN.97-01.JUL.98   PAYDATE	17.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSSELDORF     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  715.75 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE	 ISSUE	  PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	750  DEM	7.86 DEM     15.77 PCT    9.11 X</p>
<p> CALL	800 DEM	 6.00 DEM     20.15 PCT    11.93 X</p>
<p> CALL	850 DEM	 4.54  EM     25.10 PCT    15.77 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
